15:41.140 --> 15:45.090
<b>Really? Thank you, I don't mind if I do.</b>

16:16.670 --> 16:20.010
<b>You get to die after drinking
plenty of the wine you love.</b>

16:20.010 --> 16:21.770
<b>I'd like some thanks for that.</b>

16:23.040 --> 16:24.510
<b>What?!</b>

16:26.180 --> 16:27.520
<b>How?!</b>

16:27.520 --> 16:27.650
<b>You're cheap.
How?!</b>

16:27.650 --> 16:29.010
<b>You're cheap.</b>

16:29.820 --> 16:32.720
<b>Attacking us while we're
drunk and passed out?</b>

16:32.720 --> 16:34.860
<b>You won't be popular with the ladies.</b>

16:34.860 --> 16:36.650
<b>I can't approve.</b>

16:40.800 --> 16:44.660
<b>Hey, wake up, you stupid monkey.
Your friends are here for you.</b>

16:46.270 --> 16:48.000
<b>What the heck?</b>

16:48.000 --> 16:50.300
<b>Hey, what's with these guys?!</b>

16:50.300 --> 16:52.910
<b>I was certain I'd hidden
my intent to kill.</b>

16:52.910 --> 16:54.180
<b>When did you realize?</b>

16:54.180 --> 16:54.410
<b>Moron, the wine was too good.
When did you realize?</b>

16:54.410 --> 16:57.170
<b>Moron, the wine was too good.</b>

16:58.250 --> 17:00.780
<b>Among the wines presented
at the contest,</b>

17:00.780 --> 17:04.620
<b>there was some of the same monkey
wine we found in the forest.</b>

17:04.620 --> 17:06.520
<b>Of course we'd think it was weird.</b>

17:06.520 --> 17:09.490
<b>Shoot, I never thought you'd notice.</b>

17:09.490 --> 17:11.010
<b>We're connoisseurs.</b>

17:12.130 --> 17:14.330
<b>I bet those small fry demons
from earlier in the day</b>

17:14.330 --> 17:15.990
<b>were your work too.</b>

17:17.400 --> 17:20.000
<b>But your finish was weak.</b>

17:20.000 --> 17:21.900
<b>Damn it.</b>

17:21.900 --> 17:24.470
<b>My name's Shin, Shin Taijin!</b>

17:24.470 --> 17:26.870
<b>I'll take your lives!</b>

17:26.870 --> 17:28.340
<b>Get them!</b>

17:29.310 --> 17:31.340
<b>That's dirty! Fight your own battles!</b>

17:32.480 --> 17:36.050
<b>The monkeys will be more than
enough to handle drunks!</b>

17:36.050 --> 17:38.420
<b>I can't say I like your methods.</b>

17:40.620 --> 17:42.960
<b>There's nothing we can do at this rate!</b>

17:42.960 --> 17:44.420
<b>Let's go somewhere else!</b>

17:45.660 --> 17:48.320
<b>What's the matter? You're
staggering around.</b>

17:51.400 --> 17:52.870
<b>Hey, monkeys!</b>

17:54.770 --> 17:56.540
<b>It might be a waste,</b>

17:56.540 --> 17:59.340
<b>but I'll teach you the set
phrase for times like this.</b>

18:00.040 --> 18:01.510
<b>Let's take it outside!</b>

18:04.150 --> 18:07.350
<b>Sheesh, monkeys are always
such a pain in the butt.</b>

18:07.350 --> 18:08.980
<b>Who're you talking about?!</b>

18:08.980 --> 18:10.920
<b>Don't ask when you already
know the answer!</b>

18:10.920 --> 18:14.560
<b>Goku, the monkeys are
just being manipulated.</b>

18:14.560 --> 18:16.290
<b>Please go easy on them.</b>

18:16.290 --> 18:17.590
<b>Got it!</b>

18:17.590 --> 18:17.790
<b>What a bothersome group!
Got it!</b>

18:17.790 --> 18:19.090
<b>What a bothersome group!</b>

18:24.530 --> 18:26.200
<b>What fools.</b>

18:26.200 --> 18:29.430
<b>Getting out into the open isn't going
to change their opponents.</b>

18:31.870 --> 18:33.440
<b>Impossible!</b>

18:33.440 --> 18:35.010
<b>Thanks for waiting.</b>

18:35.010 --> 18:37.980
<b>You didn't kill them all?!</b>

18:37.980 --> 18:39.710
<b>Nope.</b>

18:39.710 --> 18:42.380
<b>You're not the only one used
to dealing with monkeys.</b>

18:43.220 --> 18:44.680
<b>I'm NOT a monkey!</b>

18:45.450 --> 18:46.920
<b>So this is it!</b>

18:48.120 --> 18:49.590
<b>Idiot!</b>

18:58.700 --> 19:01.000
<b>Oh, you're awake!</b>

19:03.100 --> 19:04.340
<b>Stop it! Hey, that tickles!</b>

19:04.340 --> 19:06.770
<b>Aw, you're getting along so well!
Stop it! Hey, that tickles!</b>

19:06.770 --> 19:09.640
<b>Come to think of it, that was
mean of you, Sanzo.</b>

19:09.640 --> 19:11.910
<b>Pretending to be drunk...</b>

19:11.910 --> 19:13.380
<b>No...</b>

19:14.010 --> 19:15.500
<b>Being drunk was real.</b>

19:16.480 --> 19:20.210
<b>But there was a saying I learned
a long time ago.</b>

19:22.290 --> 19:25.820
<b>I know, Kouryuu, I shall teach
you a great saying.</b>

19:26.430 --> 19:29.420
<b>It may become useful when
you've grown up.</b>

19:32.330 --> 19:34.600
<b>Consume wine but don't
be consumed by it.</b>

19:37.840 --> 19:41.240
<b>Oh? They have such poor manners.</b>

19:42.010 --> 19:43.480
<b>Don't you agree, Sanzo?</b>

19:46.880 --> 19:48.350
<b>Ah, well.</b>

19:58.760 --> 20:00.250
<b>Kouryuu!</b>

20:01.800 --> 20:03.260
<b>Kouryuu!</b>

20:05.870 --> 20:07.700
<b>Master...</b>

20:07.700 --> 20:09.430
<b>Now, let us have a drink.</b>

20:10.300 --> 20:12.070
<b>But I'm...</b>

20:34.300 --> 20:37.990
<b>Oh, wine has never tasted so good.</b>

20:46.610 --> 20:55.410
<b>Yukikau hito wa mina
omoi nimotsu seotte</b>

20:56.780 --> 21:07.220
<b>Touku ni yureru kagerou no
naka ni ashita o mitsukeru</b>

21:08.560 --> 21:18.700
<b>Kono te o kobore-ochiru
suna no you na kanjou</b>

21:20.010 --> 21:32.990
<b>Ano toki mune ni sasatta
kotoba ga fui ni uzuku kedo</b>

21:32.990 --> 21:44.470
<b>Hatenai yoru o kazoenagara
jibun no kakera sagashite ita</b>

21:44.470 --> 21:55.710
<b>Ushinau hodo ni kono omoi
ga tashika ni natteku</b>

21:55.710 --> 22:07.920
<b>lma nara kitto aruite
yukeru doko made mo</b>
